<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Dear Permit Holder,</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">As part of the new German Village parking plan, the current A permit zone will be removed and replaced with the new GV permit zone.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>No action is required on your end. Your “A” parking permit will be changing to a “GV” permit. Please check the portal after September 17 to verify the change.</strong>  </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Please note, the restriction is changing to be consistent throughout the neighborhood, check the posted signage. The new permit restriction allows any non-permit holder to park for 3 hours without a permit 8 a.m. to 12 a.m. (midnight).</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong><em>Enforcement of GV permits in this area will begin November 3.</em></strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">If you have any further questions or concerns, please email <a href="mailto:parkingservices@columbus.gov" title="mailto:parkingservices@columbus.gov" data-outlook-id="9f172824-508f-44c3-83d3-39876496d3af" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">parkingservices@columbus.gov</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Thank you,<br>Columbus Division of Mobility and Parking Services</p>
